            -> Filter: (`<subquery6>`.user_id = <cache>((@user_id)))  (cost=0.102 rows=1)
                -> Single-row index lookup on <subquery6> using <auto_distinct_key> (antireq_course_id = c.course_id, user_id = '1')  (cost=51.3..51.3 rows=1)
                    -> Materialize with deduplication  (cost=51.2..51.2 rows=105)
                        -> Filter: ((a.antireq_course_id is not null) and (taken.user_id is not null))  (cost=26.9 rows=105)
                            -> Nested loop inner join  (cost=26.9 rows=105)
                                -> Filter: (taken.`status` in ('completed','in_progress'))  (cost=4.86 rows=46)
                                    -> Index lookup on taken using PRIMARY (user_id = (@user_id))  (cost=4.86 rows=46)
                                -> Covering index lookup on a using PRIMARY (course_id = taken.course_id)  (cost=0.256 rows=2.29)
        -> Filter: (`<subquery4>`.user_id = <cache>((@user_id)))  (cost=0.102 rows=1)
            -> Single-row index lookup on <subquery4> using <auto_distinct_key> (user_id = '1', course_id = c.course_id)  (cost=15.6..15.6 rows=1)
                -> Materialize with deduplication  (cost=15.5..15.5 rows=46)
